---
import type {Project} from '../data/projects';
import {projectBomMissingParts} from '../data/catalog-staging';
interface Props { project:Project }
const {project}=Astro.props;
const demo=project.slug==='microduck-robot'?'Seven source-creator videos hosted on MAKHEX':project.slug==='mosaico-learning-assistant'?'English concept video (not physical device proof)':'Credited physical reference photo; no MAKHEX-hosted build video';
const designs=project.slug==='microduck-robot'?'Source 3MF/STL and HAT/IMU projects referenced through the member library and original creator':'mosaico-learning-assistant'===project.slug?'Upstream reference software; no commercial firmware redistribution rights':'No verified local fabrication-ready CAD or 3D files supplied';
const gaps=projectBomMissingParts[project.slug]??[];
---
<section class="content-section" aria-label="Build completeness and downloads" id="build-resources">
  <span class="eyebrow">BUILD RESOURCE STATUS</span>
  <h2>What is available, and what is still missing.</h2>
  <p>MAKHEX separates source material and proposed instructions from independently validated builds. A parts cart is a planning list, not a paid checkout.</p>
  <div class="resource-audit-grid">
    <div><strong>Instructions</strong><p>MAKHEX build sequence and GitHub README provided; physical reproduction on the exact MAKHEX BOM is not certified.</p></div>
    <div><strong>Pictures and videos</strong><p>{demo}</p></div>
    <div><strong>Design documents / 3D models</strong><p>{designs}</p></div>
    <div><strong>Parts and ordering</strong><p>Component research pages and a parts checklist exist; complete exact-option supplier matching, shipping, and automated fulfillment are unverified. Paid checkout is unavailable.</p></div>
  </div>
  {gaps.length>0&&<details class="resource-audit-details"><summary>Additional build-specific blockers ({gaps.length})</summary><ul>{gaps.map(g=><li>{g}</li>)}</ul></details>}
  <p class="resource-audit-reference">See <a href={'https://github.com/polygoku/makhex/tree/main/builds/'+project.slug} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">source instructions</a> and <a href="/shop/">component research catalog</a>. Files are linked only when they actually exist and can be shared.</p>
</section>
<style>
.resource-audit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.9rem;margin:1.1rem 0}
.resource-audit-grid>div{border:1px solid rgba(40,58,51,.19);border-radius:10px;padding:1rem;background:#f7f3eb}
.resource-audit-grid strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.4rem}
.resource-audit-grid p{margin:0;line-height:1.55;font-size:.9rem}
.resource-audit-details{padding:.8rem;border-top:1px solid #c8c8b9}
.resource-audit-details summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:650}
.resource-audit-details li{margin:.5rem 0}
.resource-audit-reference{font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.5}
@media(max-width:640px){.resource-audit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
